---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { products, formatRupiah } from '../lib/products';
const featured = products[0];
---
<Base>
  <div class="announcement"><span class="spark">✳</span> INDEPENDENT OBJECTS FOR EXTRAORDINARY DAYS <span class="announcement-end">MADE TO BE WORN & LOVED <span class="spark">✳</span></span></div>
  <header class="site-header" id="top">
    <div class="shell header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Kolkative Store Home"><span class="logo-symbol">✳</span> KOLKATIVE<span class="logo-dot">.</span><span class="logo-small">STORE</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Navigasi"><a href="#shop">SHOP ALL</a><a href="#story">OUR STORY</a><a href="#footer">CONTACT</a></nav>
      <div class="header-right"><a href="/" class="track-link" id="resume-order-link" hidden>TRACK ORDER ↗</a><span class="header-caption">EST. FOR THE CURIOUS</span><button type="button" class="cart-trigger" id="open-cart" aria-label="Buka keranjang">BAG <span id="cart-count" class="cart-count">0</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8h16l-1.3 12H5.3L4 8ZM9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero shell" aria-label="Featured collection">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> COLLECTION 001 / EVERYDAY OBJECTS</div>
        <h1>GOOD<br/>STUFF<span class="asterisk">✳</span><br/><em>ONLY.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">Bukan sekadar barang. Ini soal detail kecil yang bikin hari-hari biasa terasa sedikit lebih menarik.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-cta" href="#shop">EXPLORE THE DROP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="hero-index">[ 01 — 06 ]<br/>A CURATED SELECTION</span></div>
        <div class="hero-side-caption">DESIGNED FOR THE IN-BETWEEN MOMENTS.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art"><div class="hero-image-wrap"><div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-1"></div><div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-2"></div><div class="hero-stamp">NOT YOUR<br/>USUAL<br/><b>UNIFORM.</b> <span>↗</span></div><img src="/products/tee.svg" width="600" height="650" alt="Signal oversized t-shirt" class="hero-product" /></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>FEATURED OBJECT #001</span><span>{featured.name.toUpperCase()} <span class="hero-bottom-price">{formatRupiah(featured.price)}</span></span></div></div>
    </section>
    <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ticker-track">GOOD DESIGN IS EVERYDAY <span>✳</span> NOT JUST FOR SPECIAL OCCASIONS <span>✳</span> COLLECT WHAT YOU LOVE <span>✳</span> GOOD DESIGN IS EVERYDAY <span>✳</span> NOT JUST FOR SPECIAL OCCASIONS <span>✳</span> COLLECT WHAT YOU LOVE <span>✳</span></div></div>
    <section class="shop-section shell" id="shop">
      <div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE LINEUP / VOL. 001</div><h2>THE <em>GOOD</em> GOODS<span class="section-star">✳</span></h2><p class="section-description">Handpicked essentials for wherever you are going next.</p></div><div class="product-count">06 OBJECTS<br/>ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES ↘</div></div>
      <div class="toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter kategori"><button class="filter active" data-category="All" aria-pressed="true">ALL ITEMS <span>06</span></button><button class="filter" data-category="Apparel" aria-pressed="false">APPAREL</button><button class="filter" data-category="Accessories" aria-pressed="false">ACCESSORIES</button><button class="filter" data-category="Prints" aria-pressed="false">PRINTS</button></div><label class="search-wrap"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m15 15 5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg><input id="search-products" type="search" placeholder="SEARCH GOODS..." aria-label="Cari produk" /></label></div>
      <div class="product-grid" id="product-grid">
        {products.map((product, index) => <article class={`product-card`} data-category={product.category} data-search={`${product.name} ${product.description}`.toLowerCase()}>
          <div class={`product-art bg-${product.color}`}><span class="product-no">[ {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} ]</span>{product.tag && <span class="product-tag">{product.tag}</span>}<img src={product.image} width="520" height="520" alt={product.name} loading="lazy"/><button class="quick-add" data-add={product.id} type="button" aria-label={`Tambahkan ${product.name} ke keranjang`}>ADD TO BAG <span>↗</span></button></div>
          <div class="product-meta"><span class="product-category">{product.category.toUpperCase()} / KOLKATIVE GOODS</span><span class="product-name">{product.name}</span><span class="product-price">{formatRupiah(product.price)}</span></div>
        </article>)}
      </div>
      <p class="empty-search" id="empty-search" hidden>No objects found. Try another search.</p>
      <div class="shop-bottom"><span>✳ A LITTLE DIFFERENT. A LOT MORE YOU.</span><a href="#top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="story-section" id="story"><div class="shell story-layout"><div class="story-art"><span class="story-art-mini">INDEPENDENT SPIRIT<br/>EST. TODAY</span><span class="story-star">✳</span><span class="story-art-bottom">DO MORE OF WHAT MAKES YOU FEEL ALIVE.</span></div><div class="story-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A NOTE FROM US</div><h2>LESS ORDINARY.<br/><em>MORE YOU.</em></h2><p>KOLKATIVE STORE lahir dari keyakinan bahwa karya, style, dan cerita nggak harus nunggu momen besar. Koleksi kecil, karakter besar. Dibuat untuk dipakai, dibawa, dan jadi bagian dari kisah sehari-hari.</p><a href="#shop" class="story-link">FIND YOUR FAVORITE <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="newsletter shell"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE INSIDE TRACK</span><h2>GOOD THINGS<br/>ARE <em>COMING.</em></h2></div><div class="newsletter-right"><p>Something fresh is always around the corner. Follow our next creative drop.</p><a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="secondary-cta">FOLLOW THE JOURNEY ↗</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer" id="footer"><div class="shell"><div class="footer-main"><span class="footer-brand">KOLKATIVE<span>.</span><small>STORE</small></span><div><div class="footer-label">NAVIGATE</div><a href="#top">HOME</a><a href="#shop">SHOP ALL</a><a href="#story">OUR STORY</a></div><div><div class="footer-label">THE FINE PRINT</div><span>INDONESIAN RUPIAH (IDR)</span><span>PAYMENTS BY MAYAR</span><span>DEMO MERCH CATALOG</span></div><div class="footer-quote">KEEP<br/>MAKING<br/><i>THINGS.</i> ✳</div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} KOLKATIVE STORE. MADE WITH INTENTION.</span><span>DESIGNED TO BE DIFFERENT ↗</span></div></div></footer>

  <div class="cart-overlay" id="cart-overlay" hidden></div>
  <aside class="cart-panel" id="cart-panel" aria-label="Keranjang belanja" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="drawer-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SELECTION</span><h2>THE BAG <span id="drawer-cart-count">(0)</span></h2></div><button type="button" class="close-cart" id="close-cart" aria-label="Tutup keranjang">✕</button></div>
    <div class="drawer-items" id="drawer-items"></div>
    <div class="drawer-checkout"><div class="drawer-total"><span>SUBTOTAL</span><strong id="drawer-total">Rp0</strong></div><small>Biaya tambahan, jika ada, ditampilkan di halaman pembayaran Mayar.</small>
      <form id="checkout-form" class="checkout-form"><div class="checkout-label">YOUR DETAILS <span>↘</span></div><label>FULL NAME<input name="name" type="text" placeholder="Nama lengkap" maxlength="90" minlength="2" autocomplete="name" required /></label><label>EMAIL ADDRESS<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label>WHATSAPP NUMBER<input name="mobile" type="tel" placeholder="081234567890" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required /></label><p id="checkout-error" class="checkout-error" role="alert" hidden></p><button class="checkout-button" id="checkout-button" type="submit">CONTINUE TO PAYMENT <span>↗</span></button></form>
      <div class="checkout-trust">↗ SECURE CHECKOUT POWERED BY MAYAR</div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div id="toast" class="toast" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <script id="product-catalog" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify(products).replace(/</g, '\\u003c')} />
  <script>import '../scripts/store.ts';</script>
</Base>
